    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;<strong>Brews &amp; Blood: Origin&quot;</strong> is a\u00a0Atmospheric Horror game where you need to manage <strong>a liquor shop</strong> in a <strong>remote Indian village</strong> and escape it's horror.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your uncle calls you for a last-minute favor\u2014he needs you to cover a <strong>one-night shift</strong> at his liquor shop in a remote Indian village.\u00a0But why did your uncle choose to hand over his shop to someone else on the very <strong>night of the Red Moon?</strong> The truth is revealed as the night unfolds.\u00a0<u><strong>One shift. One cursed night. Will you survive the horrors of the Red Moon?</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496780/extras/fe908b16bf9b6b84af9272fd9eddfedf.poster.avif?t=1745844391\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496780/extras/fe908b16bf9b6b84af9272fd9eddfedf.webm?t=1745844391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496780/extras/fe908b16bf9b6b84af9272fd9eddfedf.mp4?t=1745844391\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-Person Horror Simulation:</strong> Manage the liquor shop, serve customers, and complete small tasks\u2014until the horror takes over.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Atmospheric Horror:</strong> A slow-burn experience where fear creeps in through eerie silence, disturbing visuals, and unsettling encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Horror Chase Sequences:</strong> As the curse takes hold, terrifying entities will hunt you\u2014run, hide, or find a way to fight back.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Car Driving Mechanics:</strong> Escape through the haunted village in a desperate drive for survival, but the roads may not lead where you expect.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;<strong>Brews &amp; Blood: Origin&quot;</strong> is a\u00a0Atmospheric Horror game where you need to manage <strong>a liquor shop</strong> in a <strong>remote Indian village</strong> and escape it's horror.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your uncle calls you for a last-minute favor\u2014he needs you to cover a <strong>one-night shift</strong> at his liquor shop in a remote Indian village.\u00a0But why did your uncle choose to hand over his shop to someone else on the very <strong>night of the Red Moon?</strong> The truth is revealed as the night unfolds.\u00a0<u><strong>One shift. One cursed night. Will you survive the horrors of the Red Moon?</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496780/extras/fe908b16bf9b6b84af9272fd9eddfedf.poster.avif?t=1745844391\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496780/extras/fe908b16bf9b6b84af9272fd9eddfedf.webm?t=1745844391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496780/extras/fe908b16bf9b6b84af9272fd9eddfedf.mp4?t=1745844391\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-Person Horror Simulation:</strong> Manage the liquor shop, serve customers, and complete small tasks\u2014until the horror takes over.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Atmospheric Horror:</strong> A slow-burn experience where fear creeps in through eerie silence, disturbing visuals, and unsettling encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Horror Chase Sequences:</strong> As the curse takes hold, terrifying entities will hunt you\u2014run, hide, or find a way to fight back.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Car Driving Mechanics:</strong> Escape through the haunted village in a desperate drive for survival, but the roads may not lead where you expect.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
